8)reverse

reverse(s.begin(),s.end())

9)// STRING ROTATION

right rotation of string: formula: no.of rotations = no.of rotations % length of string
                          substring = str.substr(len - no.of rotations, no.of rotations) + str.substr(0, len - no.of rotations);

left rotation of string: formula: no.of rotations = no.of rotations % length of string
                         substring = str.substr(no.of rotations, len - no.of rotations) + str.substr(0, no.of rotations);  

note: substr(start_index, length) is used to get the substring of a string.




